                            <h2 class="case-htags mb-3">
                                Overview
                            </h2>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text col-lg-8 mx-auto">
                                Zuriva is an AI-powered digital bank designed around how Africans actually save, spend and send
                                money. Customers open an account from their phone, hold several local currencies, pay
                                with virtual or physical cards, connect mobile money and buy or hold stablecoins in the
                                same app.
                            </p>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text">
                                The platform also serves the financial sector itself. Banks, microfinance institutions,
                                fintechs and payment companies can plug into Zuriva's services to launch products
                                faster, without building a full banking stack from scratch.


                            </p>

                            <p class="pawqeris-overview-text mb-4">
                                Clarisco Solutions delivered the project from concept to launch, covering strategy, UX,
                                core banking architecture, card and crypto integrations, compliance workflows, and
                                testing.
                            </p>

                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="row justify-content-center">
